# Force LF line endings regardless of what tool/OS last touched a file.
# Root cause of the recurring Palomar patch_format failure: OneDrive/Windows
# editors kept resaving .gitignore/Challenge.lean/README.md/Solution.lean/
# comparator.json with CRLF, which `git diff --check` (Palomar's patch_format
# phase) flags as trailing whitespace on every line. Normalizing on checkout
# and commit stops that from recurring.
* text=auto eol=lf
